  "claim_scope": "GlobalSettlementABI V1 host admission binds each disclosed route effect plan to the exact verified route journal and occurrence, then uses one deterministic checked Python/Rust ASSET_TRANSFER composer to derive the exact certificate-bound epoch plan before a release-selected root verifier can construct opaque VerifiedEconomicEpochV1.",
