  "failure_modes": [
    "a caller pairs valid verified route evidence with an unrelated empty or otherwise valid epoch effect plan",
    "a disclosed route effect plan differs from the root committed by its exact route journal",
    "a route effect plan consumes an occurrence other than the journal's governed command occurrence",
    "adjacent route plans contain disconnected asset-lane roots or conservation snapshots",
    "signed effect-row aggregation or unsigned fee aggregation overflows silently",
    "one occurrence is consumed by more than one route plan",
    "zero or sixty-five route plans enter the bounded composer",
    "terminal obligations, external outbox effects, or unsupported route shapes gain authority through an unproved composition law",
    "Python and Rust canonical ordering or root derivation drift"
