  "nonclaims": [
    "This packet proves deterministic host-admission behavior only. The recursive epoch guest commits effect roots and does not execute or prove route-effect aggregation.",
    "The implemented composer accepts only sequential single-lane ASSET_TRANSFER plans with zero terminal obligations and no external outbox rows; multi-lane, terminal, and delivery composition remain open.",
    "Recording verifier doubles establish exact pre-verifier binding behavior and do not establish cryptographic soundness, verifier governance, or real receipt validity.",
    "The Rust crate tests use the deterministic ABI crate and do not invoke RISC0 proving. The interrupted release-aware lane replay remains deferred to Runpod for thermal safety.",
